{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Zann Dictionary 是一款以真實情境學習英語詞彙的工具，內含超過 30,000 個高頻英語詞彙，適合想提升日常溝通或英語流利度的學習者。目前<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，原價 US $0.99。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-52.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>情境示例智能複習</h2>\n<p>Zann Dictionary 收錄超過 30,000 個高頻英語詞彙，每個詞彙透過真實情境的視聽示例呈現，讓學習更貼近實際用法。程式提供智能複習卡、間隔重複與多種練習形式，協助詞彙長期留在記憶中，並可按個人步伐調整學習節奏。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-50-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-51-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-52-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-53-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-54-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-55-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Zann Dictionary</li><li>應用類別：Education</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/zann-dictionary/id6757390232?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T15:02:18.849082+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":270,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T14:55:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T19:38:40.087408+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T14:59:30.833886+00:00","content_hash":"36a1171ec11f0a789dfba3f11eabf78f8d04be189581e5faa089083301993e79","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}